{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Lil Lootin Lizards</strong>\ud83e\udd96</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a treasure-obsessed reptile with the instincts of a loot goblin and the storage skills of a pack rat! Deep within the dungeon, ancient relics and magical artifacts are yours for the taking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Puzzle Meets Dungeon Looting!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lil Lootin Lizards is a unique blend of Tetris-style management and dungeon exploration. Every room presents new puzzles, where you must arrange and rotate various oddly-shaped relics, weapons, and treasures to solve the room as best you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tetris-Inspired Puzzles \u2013 Fit your loot onto the room to defeat monsters, collect treasure and disarm traps. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Goblin-Like Greed \u2013 Prioritize loot wisely! What you keep (or discard) changes how you tackle future puzzles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dungeon Perks &amp; Curses \u2013 Magic artifacts grant unique abilities but might come with strange side effects! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless Replayability \u2013 Procedurally generated dungeons mean no two runs are the same!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3405010?t=1742481484","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3405010?t=1742481484","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405010/60690ed0e0f2448561020b8bdb1b2681f22c246d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742481484","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405010/60690ed0e0f2448561020b8bdb1b2681f22c246d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742481484","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Lil Lootin Lizards</strong>\ud83e\udd96</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a treasure-obsessed reptile with the instincts of a loot goblin and the storage skills of a pack rat! Deep within the dungeon, ancient relics and magical artifacts are yours for the taking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Puzzle Meets Dungeon Looting!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lil Lootin Lizards is a unique blend of Tetris-style management and dungeon exploration. Every room presents new puzzles, where you must arrange and rotate various oddly-shaped relics, weapons, and treasures to solve the room as best you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tetris-Inspired Puzzles \u2013 Fit your loot onto the room to defeat monsters, collect treasure and disarm traps. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Goblin-Like Greed \u2013 Prioritize loot wisely! What you keep (or discard) changes how you tackle future puzzles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dungeon Perks &amp; Curses \u2013 Magic artifacts grant unique abilities but might come with strange side effects! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless Replayability \u2013 Procedurally generated dungeons mean no two runs are the same!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Zenflux Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405010/header.jpg?t=1742481484","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Lil Lootin Lizards","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Anything dual core or better<br></li><li><strong>Memo